      "comment": "MIRACULOUS TOMMY (1) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his superb win three back, getting around this track over 324m in 17.54. Hot win three back and looks the one to beat here. AUDREY'S MAGIC (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Maitland in a handy 22.58 beating Good Odds Keona. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. HUMBLE SMILES (7) settled close to the lead but checked in the run and turned spotting a start, missing the frame when seventh (20.00) at Bulli over 340m in a Grade 4/5. May be worth another try. HUMBLE TIGRESS (6) is not to be discarded.",
